                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9aeb7277-5656-3648-a9be-87af2d10263e",
                        "entry_id": "ec3dbd0d-c660-3f84-bd69-9f434cc71e59",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного безжалостный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f401d68-55e2-4b57-80e4-fc168736c4cb",
                                "sense_id": "9aeb7277-5656-3648-a9be-87af2d10263e",
                                "text": "Если же, сожалея о промахнувшемся убийце, я оплакиваю и самый промах, то безнравственна здесь не моя жалость к злодею, а, напротив, моя безжалостность к его жертве."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0120f8f-eedf-41c5-9a6a-dceec215fb81",
                                "sense_id": "9aeb7277-5656-3648-a9be-87af2d10263e",
                                "text": "Больше всего старика волновали хищнические порубки на его любимой Осиновой горе, которые делались приисковыми рабочими с чисто русской безжалостностью к дереву."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5ae129bc-06bc-482d-9b58-371ea481e654",
                        "source_entry_id": "ec3dbd0d-c660-3f84-bd69-9f434cc71e59",
                        "source_sense_id": "9aeb7277-5656-3648-a9be-87af2d10263e",
                        "target_lang_word": "cruelty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cruelty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf6cbb49-e5d8-37a1-8759-e409a787a4ec",
                                        "entry_id": "8f3bca5c-b189-311e-80af-52248c7988a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An indifference to suffering or pleasure in inflicting suffering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0a7ea78-34cd-444b-a4bb-fcf9e24b48d5",
                                                "sense_id": "cf6cbb49-e5d8-37a1-8759-e409a787a4ec",
                                                "text": "Fear of their cargo bred a savage cruelty into the crew. One captain, to strike terror into the rest, killed a slave and dividing heart, liver and entrails into 300 pieces made each of the slaves eat one, threatening those who refused with the same torture. Such incidents were not rare."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c5c8a07-bac2-33f6-b7fc-f40df9817046",
                                        "entry_id": "8f3bca5c-b189-311e-80af-52248c7988a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cruel act."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45c9412a-be12-4276-9ac7-e7c865a630e5",
                                                "sense_id": "5c5c8a07-bac2-33f6-b7fc-f40df9817046",
                                                "text": "The Begums' ministers, on the contrary, to extort from them the disclosure of the place which concealed the treasures, were, […] after being fettered and imprisoned, led out on to a scaffold, and this array of terrours proving unavailing, the meek tempered Middleton, as a dernier resort, menaced them with a confinement in the fortress of Chunargar. Thus, my lords, was a British garrison made the climax of cruelties!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f9136b2-c93e-4717-bdad-17269f7a2ef8",
                                                "sense_id": "5c5c8a07-bac2-33f6-b7fc-f40df9817046",
                                                "text": "Gay songwriter behind bars! Needs sincere letter to help ease the tension from cruelties inside the joint."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
